Build a verdict-valued @code{Rhs} as the product of the member verdicts in
order.  The list must be nonempty, and @code{panel []} raises the empty-panel
error of the language when forced.

@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.panelText author
@item panelText labeledMembers
Build text from labeled member blocks in order.  The list must be nonempty,
and the labels must be valid and distinct.  An invalid value raises the
